sending, by the domain control unit, the closing command to a precharging loop relay of a motor drive module to connect to the precharging loop to precharge the motor drive module;
sending, by the domain control unit, the closing command to a motor drive loop relay connected to a positive electrode of the motor drive module, to connect to a motor drive loop;
sending, by the domain control unit, a disconnect instruction to the precharging loop relay to end precharging, to complete power-on of the major loop; and
