an image capture component configured to capture a plurality of sequential images of at least a head of a test subject; and
a processor in communication with a memory storing instructions which are executed by the processor to:
extract cropped head images of the head of the test subject from the captured sequential images,
for each cropped head image, determine a gaze angle of the test subject from the cropped head image;
analyze the determined gaze angles to determine at least one of horizontal nystagmus and angle of onset of nystagmus;
estimate a level of impairment of the test subject from the determined at least one of horizontal nystagmus and angle of onset of nystagmus; and
generate a visual representation of the level of impairment of the test subject on an associated display.
