Systems and methods for producing N-body entangling interactions to simplify n-gate operations in quantum computing applications are disclosed herein. According to at least some embodiments, an oscillator generates a two-tone field tuned to qubit resonance, first upper motion-induced sidebands, first lower motion-induced sidebands, second upper motion-induced sidebands, and second lower motion-induced sidebands.
