coupling a driving region of the driving pin adjacent a proximal end of the driving pin with a driver;
wherein the bone penetrating region has a smaller cross-sectional thickness than the bone plate orienting region, the bone plate orienting region has a smaller cross-sectional thickness than the driving region, and the bone plate orienting region has a size corresponding to the fixation hole of the bone plate.
