generating phase signals from a time domain error signal based on the error signal, by oscillating when the time domain error signal is enabled and inhibiting oscillation when the time domain error signal is disabled;
quantizing the phase signals to generate the front-end output signal, wherein the front-end output signal provides additional noise shaping; and
generating an output signal based on the front-end output signal and a back-end output signal generated from a quantization error extracted from quantized phase signals, wherein the output signal has at least two noise shapings.

